---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetParcelForSale(ForSale: boolean, Options: {any}): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llSetParcelForSale(integer ForSale, list Options);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets the parcel the object is on for sale.\nForSale is a boolean, if TRUE
the parcel is put up for sale. Options is a list of options to set for the sale,
such as price, authorized buyer, and whether to include objects on the parcel.\n
Setting ForSale to FALSE will remove the parcel from sale and clear any options
that were set.</p>
  <p>This function requires that the script be owned by the parcel owner and that they have granted the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_PRIVILEGED_LAND_ACCESS" target="_blank">PERMISSION_PRIVILEGED_LAND_ACCESS</a> permission.</p>
  <p>Returns an integer Error code or 0 if successful.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">ForSale</a></td>
          <td>If TRUE, the parcel is put up for sale.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>{`{any}`}</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>list</span></td>
          <td>Options</td>
          <td>A list of options to set for the sale.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

